It opens this store if the lock password is lost. AppRafter cannot open a locked store without its lock password or its recovery key. Keep the recovery key somewhere other than this computer. The recovery key opens nothing without the vault file: include <SANDBOX>/apprafter-config/vault in your backups; it is encrypted. Clear this screen once it is saved.
